OL,3,ANepal rescuers try to reach dozens
OL,4,Atrapped in tunnel as two pulled out
OL,5,Aalive and one found dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have been rescued from a
OL,8,Ftunnel in Nepal more than a week after
OL,9,Fflash flooding hit the Nepal-Tibet
OL,10,Fborder, killing more than 1,300 people
OL,12,FAn expert tells the BBC a "Goldilocks
OL,13,Fzone" could be housing more survivors,
OL,14,Fwith 39 thought to be trapped
OL,16,FCol Jhabindra Reshmi, of Nepal's army,
OL,17,Fsays rescue efforts continue - and that
OL,18,Fmud and rocks are making entering the
OL,19,Ftunnels more difficult
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
